                <p class="text-muted">ShapeDetectionAI is a real-time shape classifier I built as a research intern at UC San Diego. It is a linear SVM that recognizes circles, squares, triangles, and stars in tiny 16×16 images, and it runs live from a webcam. I designed it with hardware in mind: the learned weights are quantized to 4-bit integers, so the same dot-product decision can map efficiently onto silicon.</p>
