              <section>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-fg">The research setting</h3>
                <p class="text-muted">From June to August 2023, I was in the ENLACE Summer Research Program at the Vertically-integrated VLSI Information Processing Lab. I worked with Prof. Mingu Kang, mentors Chang Eun Song, Zihan Xia, and Ashkan Moradi, and alongside Omar Dario Martinez Blackaller. The lab studies how to run machine-learning models on efficient custom hardware. So I made every software choice with its hardware cost in mind.</p>
                <p class="text-muted">I joined a multicultural team of researchers and PhDs from different backgrounds. I shared our findings with the academic community and stayed hands-on from data prep to the live demo and the final talk.</p>
