                <p class="text-muted">I also trained the YOLO buoy dataset that the detector runs on and compiled the TensorRT engine for our hardware. Before I trusted the loop near water, I tested it in Gazebo Harmonic and on recorded boat data. On the boat I also set up the unglamorous plumbing that field tests need. That meant udev rules that pin every serial device and a remote terminal over Holybro radios. It also meant XBee telemetry nodes that republish topics to shore.</p>
